(Grocery Buddy - LLM Handoff Brief) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1\) Project Overview) Tj
T*
(Grocery Buddy is a React Native mobile app for household grocery planning and shopping.) Tj
T*
(The core idea is to let family members create and manage shared grocery lists, then move) Tj
T*
(into a shopping-focused mode while in-store. The long-term vision is voice-first list) Tj
T*
(management plus real-time collaboration.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2\) Product Goal) Tj
T*
(Build a family grocery app that is:) Tj
T*
(? Fast for list creation and item editing) Tj
T*
(? Easy to use during shopping trips) Tj
T*
(? Designed for future voice commands and collaborative, real-time updates) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3\) Current Build Status) Tj
T*
(The app currently has a working local state architecture and core list/item CRUD flows.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Implemented now) Tj
T*
(? Create grocery lists with name + selected store) Tj
T*
(? View active lists on home screen) Tj
T*
(? Open list details by dynamic route) Tj
T*
(? Add items to a specific list) Tj
T*
(? Edit item names inline in list details) Tj
T*
(? Delete items) Tj
T*
(? "Start Shopping" button placeholder in list details) Tj
T*
(? Shared global state via React Context \(ListProvider + useLists\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Not fully implemented yet) Tj
T*
(? Dedicated shopping mode experience \(currently placeholder alert\)) Tj
T*
(? Item completion toggle UI behavior in list details \(function exists in context; UI is) Tj
T*
(not active\)) Tj
T*
(? Persistent storage \(data is in-memory only\)) Tj
T*
(? Real-time sync/collaboration backend) Tj
T*
(? Voice command pipeline) Tj
T*
(? In-app chat/messaging) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4\) Tech Stack) Tj
T*
(? Framework: Expo + React Native) Tj
T*
(? Routing: Expo Router \(file-based\)) Tj
T*
(? Language: TypeScript) Tj
T*
(? State Management: React Context API + custom hook) Tj
T*
(? UI: React Native components + @expo/vector-icons) Tj
T*
(? Testing setup: Jest \(jest-expo, ts-jest, @testing-library/react\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Package highlights) Tj
T*
(? expo ~54.0.31) Tj
T*
(? react 19.1.0) Tj
T*
(? react-native 0.81.5) Tj
T*
(? expo-router ~6.0.21) Tj
ET
endstream
