(8\) Current User Flows) Tj
T*
(Home -> Create list -> List details) Tj
T*
(1. User opens home screen and taps "Create New List") Tj
T*
(2. User enters list name and selects store) Tj
T*
(3. App creates list in context and navigates to /list/[id]) Tj
T*
(4. User adds items, edits item text inline, or deletes items) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(List details behavior) Tj
T*
(? Edit icon switches row into inline editing mode) Tj
T*
(? Save button commits update via updateItem) Tj
T*
(? Delete icon removes item via deleteItem) Tj
T*
(? "Start Shopping" currently triggers placeholder alert) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
